          </article>
          <article class="practice-item">
            <h3>Governance baselines</h3>
            <p>Subscription structure, identity model, policy, tagging, and cost boundaries, each with a stated reason.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="practice-item">
            <h3>Deployment patterns</h3>
